{"text":"Not much was happening for her, so she wrote her story, got some great investors, and she created My Big Fat Greek Wedding, which also garnered her an Academy Award nomination. Gurinda Chaddah created, directed, Bent It Like Beckham, where it's about this Indian girl who is the star of basically a Western film, because that wasn't out there. Dr. Ohina Babwachi Ajay is an amazing spinal surgeon, but on top of that, he's also created and invented tools to help the surgery go quicker and be more efficient. And so there are countless others. Chinedu Echiro, he created Hopstop, which is such a blessing living in New York. It's an app that shows you what trains to take and how to get there and how much time will take you. So if you don't have, if it's not there, you create it. And we have all the resources to be able to make that. If the resources aren't there for the tools, there are resources out there to put it out there, to ask people, what can I do to get to my dream?","words":[{"text":"Not","start":0.0,"end":0.54},{"text":"much","start":0.54,"end":0.72},{"text":"was","start":0.72,"end":0.84},{"text":"happening","start":0.84,"end":1.12},{"text":"for","start":1.12,"end":1.38},{"text":"her","start":1.38,"end":1.6,"punct":","},{"text":"so","start":1.78,"end":1.96},{"text":"she","start":1.96,"end":2.1},{"text":"wrote","start":2.1,"end":2.28},{"text":"her","start":2.28,"end":2.5},{"text":"story","start":2.5,"end":2.78,"punct":","},{"text":"got","start":2.88,"end":3.04},{"text":"some","start":3.04,"end":3.22},{"text":"great","start":3.22,"end":3.42},{"text":"investors","start":3.42,"end":3.88,"punct":","},{"text":"and","start":4.06,"end":4.16},{"text":"she","start":4.16,"end":4.34},{"text":"created","start":4.34,"end":4.64},{"text":"My","start":4.64,"end":4.84},{"text":"Big","start":4.84,"end":5.02},{"text":"Fat","start":5.02,"end":5.2},{"text":"Greek","start":5.2,"end":5.42},{"text":"Wedding","start":5.42,"end":5.68,"punct":","},{"text":"which","start":6.22,"end"